OL,3,GNEWSA'I'd never felt so alone - I
OL,4,Awanted to change that'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The lights turned on, I was told there
OL,7,Fis no heartbeat and you've got to
OL,8,Ffigure out what to do."
OL,10,FKay Crewdson lost her first baby, Reg,
OL,11,Fduring that hospital scan.
OL,13,FShe said it was the "single worst
OL,14,Fmoment of her life and never felt so
OL,15,Falone", adding that she didn't get what
OL,16,Fshe needed in terms of empathy and
OL,17,Fsupport from the sonographer who broke
OL,18,Fthe news.
